The '''Hocus-Pocus Cipher''' is an {{Epic}} [[Accessory]]. It can be {{Item Display|Recombobulator 3000{{!}}Recombobulated|}} to {{Legendary}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Hocus-Pocus Cipher''' has a chance of appearing in round 1, 3 or 4 of the [[Dark Auction]] with starting bid of {{c|10000000}}.

'''Hocus-Pocus Cipher''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
