== Bugs ==
*A '''Hocus-Pocus Cipher''' obtained from the [[Raffle of the Century]] cannot be transferred into the [[Rift]] due to its custom NBT tag indicating it was obtained from a raffle. Players attempting to transfer it will receive the following error:
{{Dialogue|&cThis item has been upgraded, enchanted, or modified! It cannot be transferred over to The Rift.}}

== Trivia ==
*Outside of the [[Rift Dimension]] it does not provide any stat boosts, same as {{Item|Bingo Talisman}} and its upgrades, which means it can only grant boosts through [[Accessory Power]].
*A common misconception is that the term "Hocus Pocus" is of Czech origin, since the word "Pokus" means "trial" or "attempt" in Czech. This however is just a coincidence.

